  {
    "episode_id": 94534,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/4/94534.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 12,
    "turn_text": "Let me ask you about the Trump administration and Trump himself. My first question is you've been in Congress for a while now. I'm sure you have dealings with people on both sides of the aisle, and I'm curious what sort of the feelings are in Congress. You don't need to reveal private conversations, obviously, but what the feelings are in Congress of people of both parties about This president and his administration and both their competence and their desire to do anything that's not sort of symbolic and their interest in actually governing.",
