        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts that the respondent will provide honest insight despite confidentiality constraints.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Political divisions in Congress are meaningful and observable through emotional or attitudinal responses.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Symbolic action versus substantive governance represents a valid and relevant distinction in evaluating presidential performance.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the presidency as requiring more than performative gestures to be effective.",
        "confidence": 0.84
